@startuml
actor Browser
node "Docker Compose host" {
 cloud "public network" {
 node "web :3000" as web
 }
 node "api-gateway :8080\npublic + private networks" as gw
 cloud "private network (internal=true)" {
 node "identity :3001" as i
 node "product :3002" as p
 node "inventory :3003" as v
 node "sales :3004" as s
 node "report :3005" as r
 database "PostgreSQL :5432\n5 databases / 5 users" as db
 queue "RabbitMQ :5672\nmanagement :15672" as mq
 }
}
Browser --> web : published 3000
Browser --> gw : published 8080
web --> gw : health proxy
gw --> i
gw --> p
gw --> v
gw --> s
gw --> r
i --> db
p --> db
v --> db
s --> db
r --> db
s --> mq
mq --> r
note bottom of db
No published DB or broker ports.
Compose target; runtime not verified for DEV-7.
end note
@enduml
